      "message": "Thanks for reporting the issue and taking a stab at fixing it.  It sure looks like this was introduced by https://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/pdfium/+/124850\n\nI think the culprit is the early return at https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/pdfium/core/fpdftext/cpdf_textpage.cpp;drc\u003d9047dd7346f0587ae6f04730b2d5bc82b828d7c8;l\u003d671\n\nand the right thing to do is to always push the character into the appropriate buf before doing the early return.  Lei?",
